5. She enjoys anime and regularly discusses it with her audience. (Verbatim: "Here to... Discuss anime with you all.")
6. She has a playful association with the fictional "Church of the Goose" and refers to herself jokingly as the "Goose Queen." (Verbatim: "6 months with the Goose Queen already." / "Yes, I condone the Church of the Goose.")
