9. She prefers using 24-hour clocks to avoid time confusion. (Verbatim: "see this is why we live by a 24 hour 24 hour clocks my beloved")
10. She has a self-aware sense of humor about forgetting things, citing a 30% chance of remembering viewer requests. (Verbatim: "I'll give you like a 30% chance that I'll remember. Which isn't a very high chance, I'll be honest.") [end of text]



