4. She dislikes saying "bye-bye" and prefers "see you later" instead. (Verbatim: "It is not a bye-bye. Because I don't like bye-byes. Okay? Because bye-byes, fuck.")  
5. She values giving good vibes to her audience. (Verbatim: "Yo, I'm here to give good vibes. I think. I try. Take my good vibes.")  
6. She plans to solo play *League of Legends Swarm*, a game similar to *Vampire Survivors* or *OloCure* with League themes. (Verbatim: "I'm back this time... yapping while I solo play League of Legends Swarm, which is basically Vampire Survivors slash OloCure but League of Legends themes.")  
7. She has a playful, pun-based sense of humor and acknowledges when jokes are puns. (Verbatim: "I believe these stories in the first half and then they're heckin' puns!")  
8. She refers to being "bamboozled" by her audience, suggesting they often trick or surprise her. (Verbatim: "I keep getting bamboozled. My boozles keep being bammed by you guys.")  
9. She expresses deep affection for her viewers, repeatedly saying "I love you." (Verbatim: "I love you. I love you. I love you.")  
10. She anthropomorphizes nature, joking about insulting a tree's appearance. (Verbatim: "Today I told a tree it had ugly green hair. It decided to get upset at me and it leaves.") [end of text]



